sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Human
  participant TA as Takeover API
  participant Reg as Session Registry
  participant Lease as Takeover Lease
  participant CLI as CLI Session
  participant Replay
  participant EV as Event Log
  Human->>TA: request takeover(target, mode)
  TA->>Reg: find active session
  Reg-->>TA: session + current state
  TA->>Lease: compare-and-set epoch
  alt epoch 已过期
    Lease-->>TA: 409 stale epoch
    TA-->>Human: 拒绝，不注入输入
  else 获得租约
    Lease-->>TA: interactive lease
    TA->>CLI: pause at next turn boundary
    CLI-->>Replay: history + checkpoint
    Replay-->>Human: 回放历史
    Human->>TA: input / interrupt
    TA->>CLI: route input to same session
    Human->>TA: release
    TA->>CLI: resume from checkpoint
    TA->>EV: takeover.opened / input / released
  end
  Note over CLI,Lease: 设备动作执行中不暂停；幂等键禁止重复副作用
